proton-autogen (3.1.6) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and encouragement throughout the development of proton-autogen.
  * Improved progress spinner handling with automatic stop detection and better thread lifecycle management.
  * Enhanced launch progress reporting and improved feedback during Proton execution phases.
  * Added intelligent Steam AppID detection system.
  * Added automatic Steam AppID resolution from environment variables, Steam app manifests, steam_appid.txt files and known game executables.
  * Improved Steam compatibility variable generation using detected AppID values.
  * Added additional AppID diagnostics to improve user understanding of Proton launch configuration.
  * Improved GameMode integration reliability and fixed environment handling issues.
  * Improved MangoHud and GameMode compatibility during game startup.
  * Stabilized Proton launch environment initialization.
  * Improved executable detection and runtime configuration handling.
  * Improved compatibility prefix management and launch session stability.
  * Enhanced logging information for runtime detection and troubleshooting.
  * Improved error handling across game launch workflows.
  * Fixed various synchronization issues in background tasks.
  * Fixed progress reporting inconsistencies during long-running operations.
  * Fixed several configuration and environment propagation issues.
  * Improved internal code structure and reduced redundant processing.
  * General stability improvements and code cleanup.

